"pmid">15567861</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.1101786</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>de Visser</surname><given-names>JAGM</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoekstra</surname><given-names>RF</given-names></name><name><surname>van den Ende</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Test of interaction between genetic markers that affect fitness in <italic>Aspergillus niger</italic></article-title><source>Evolution</source><year>1997</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>1499</fpage><lpage>1505</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2307/2411202</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Whitlock</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bourguet</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors affecting the genetic load in <italic>Drosophila </italic>: synergistic epistasis and correlations among fitness components</article-title><source>Evolution</source><year>2000</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>1654</fpage><lpage>1660</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11108592</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1554/0014-3820(2000)054[1654:FATGLI]2.0.CO;2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Szafraniec</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Wloch</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Sliwa</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Borts</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name><name><surname>Korona</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Small fitness effects and weak genetic interactions between deleterious mutations in heterozygous loci of the yeast <italic>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</italic></article-title><source>Genet 